              "interlaced, and the bridge takes progressive pictures only. It plays as Kodi plays "
              "it, from its base layer";
     case StreamKeptOut::STEREO:
-      return "Dolby Vision is not used for this video, natively or reconstructed: it is 3D (" +
-             stereoMode +
-             "), and the bridge takes the pictures of one view only. It plays as Kodi plays it, "
-             "from its base layer";
+      // (Hades: native output carries one picture, never two views; the reconstruction takes each
+      // view as a picture of its own where it is had, CWinSystemBase::RebuildsDolbyVisionIn3D(),
+      // and the line "3D video (...): goes out as ..." says what went out)
+      return "native Dolby Vision output is not used for this video: it is 3D (" + stereoMode +
